OL,3,GNEWSA'People before profit': Poundland
OL,4,Astaff protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FChants of "save our jobs" filled the
OL,7,Fair outside the Poundland headquarters
OL,8,Fas workers protested while the chain
OL,9,Fedged towards collapse.
OL,11,FThe retailer's bosses have filed a
OL,12,Fnotice of intention to appoint
OL,13,Fadministrators, which will give the
OL,14,Fbusiness 10 days to find a rescue deal.
OL,16,FOn Thursday afternoon, dozens of staff
OL,17,Fmembers gathered in Walsall armed with
OL,18,Fplacards bearing a range of messages,
OL,19,Fincluding "people before profit" and
OL,20,F"Gordon Brothers, 12,000 jobs are not a
OL,21,Fwrite off!".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
