OL,3,GNEWSA'People before profit': Poundland
OL,4,Astaff protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe board of Poundland Limited said it
OL,7,F"recognises any sale process creates
OL,8,Funcertainty" and thanked staff for
OL,9,Ftheir support.
